id: pm-web-4fgv
title: Graph auto-sync provisions an extension before checking whether Neo4j is configured
description: "Every item mutation schedules graph synchronization. With no Neo4j credentials, syncProjectGraph still installs and activates pm-graph in the workspace before syncGraphToNeo4j refuses the operation. This causes unnecessary network work, workspace mutation, delayed failures, and slow test teardown. Validate graph configuration before provisioning; retain both existing failure notifications and prove the behavior over real HTTP and SSE."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-05T05:07:55.330Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-05T05:54:49.286Z"
author: codex-sol
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: An unconfigured graph sync delivers both established SSE error aliases to two clients without creating extension state or changing workspace settings.
parent: pm-web-fy9a
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-05T05:19:30.701Z",codex-sol,"Regression fails before the fix: unconfigured auto-sync cannot report its expected failure to both HTTP SSE viewers within five seconds because it first provisions pm-graph. Validate credentials before any graph assembly/provisioning and retain both failure event spellings. The regression also checks byte-identical workspace settings and no installed graph extension."
  "2026-10-05T05:30:38.388Z",codex-sol,"Verified fix with real HTTP/SSE and two viewers: graph-sync-failed and its legacy spelling carry the same configuration error, settings stay byte-identical, and no graph package is provisioned. The linked pm test passes. Concurrent same-key requests/replay, competing item edits with verified history, presence session ownership, and default filesystem watcher delivery also pass. Test-pool teardown removes the former 30-second idle wait without changing production pool settings."
files[3]{path,scope}:
  src/routes/pm.ts,project
  test/helpers/live-sse.ts,project
  test/pm-collaboration.test.ts,project
tests[1]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  node scripts/with-test-db.ts node --test --test-name-pattern=unconfigured test/pm-collaboration.test.ts,project,codex-sol,"2026-10-05T05:27:33.681Z",local_mutation,test/full-source-coverage-gate
